  22: ELIGIBLE_COMPLETED_NO_RESULTS_POSTED -- completed, with nothing posted to ClinicalTrials.gov. A
  23: completed trial very often reports in a journal and never back-fills the registry. The PubMed
  24: limb for these readings HAS NOT BEEN SCREENED (523 records stand unscreened), so publication
  25: status here is UNKNOWN, not zero. Every page says so.
