codex
- Line 191 — ZERO CONFLATED WITH ABSENT.  
  Exact input: `assess("X", [{"nct":"A","state":"READ","comparator_families_present":["PLACEBO"],"registered_primary_title":"t","registered_primary_description_verbatim":""}], ["A"])`  
  Consequence: returns `NO_ESTIMATE_POSSIBLE_NOTHING_HAS_REPORTED` even though one trial has reported.

- Line 175 — NEGATION DROPPED.  
  Exact input: `fuses({"registered_primary_title":"Pericarditis recurrence without bleeding events","registered_primary_description_verbatim":""})`  
  Consequence: returns `True` for P45 because it matches `bleed` and `recurrence`, even though bleeding is explicitly excluded.

- Line 126 — SELECTOR KEYED TO OVER-BROAD TEXT FORM.  
  Exact input: `comparator_family("No placebo / open label")`  
  Consequence: returns `PLACEBO`, so a negated placebo label is counted as a placebo comparator.

- Line 238 — STATUS FIELD REPORTS MORE THAN THE WORK ESTABLISHES.  
  Exact input: `assess("X", [{"nct":"A","state":"READ","comparator_families_present":["PLACEBO"],"registered_primary_title":"x","registered_primary_description_verbatim":""},{"nct":"B","state":"READ","comparator_families_present":["PLACEBO"],"registered_primary_title":"x","registered_primary_description_verbatim":""},{"nct":"C","state":"READ","comparator_families_present":["ACTIVE_COMPARATOR"],"registered_primary_title":"y","registered_primary_description_verbatim":""}], ["A","B"])`  
  Consequence: P38/P37 fail because of unreported `C`, but `all_failing_limbs_reported` is still `True`.

- Line 530 — CHECK THAT CANNOT FAIL MEANINGFULLY.  
  Exact input: any generated page string from `PAGE.format(...)`, because line 424 hardcodes `<span class="tag">No pooled estimate</span>`.  
  Consequence: the check proves only that the template marker remains, not that the object/page actually has no pooled estimate.

- Line 521 — OVERWRITE GUARD CHECKS DIFFERENT WRITE SET.  
